OL,3,GNEWSA'Cult' priest denies sexually
OL,4,Aassaulting women
OL,5,
OL,6,FA priest has denied sexually assaulting
OL,7,Fwomen in a "cult" within the Church of
OL,8,FEngland, telling a court there was
OL,9,F"nothing wrong" with members of his
OL,10,Fcongregation giving him massages in his
OL,11,Fbedroom.
OL,13,FChris Brain, 69, accepted he had sexual
OL,14,Fcontact with some members of the Nine
OL,15,FO'Clock Service (NOS), a group which he
OL,16,Fled in Sheffield in the 1980s and
OL,17,F1990s, but insisted this was always
OL,18,Fconsensual.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
