OL,3,GNEWSA'Cult' priest denies sexually
OL,4,Aassaulting women
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former musician has already been
OL,7,Fconvicted of sexual offences against
OL,8,F"numerous" women, a jury at Inner
OL,9,FLondon Crown Court has been told.
OL,11,FBrain, of Wilmslow in Cheshire, is
OL,12,Fbeing retried on a charge of rape and
OL,13,Ffour counts of indecent assault after
OL,14,Fjurors last year were unable to reach
OL,15,Fverdicts.
